.TH OHGREAT 1
.SH NAME
ohgreat \- song and lyrics player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/ohgreat
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I OhGreat
plays a song by Terry A. Davis, ported from the TempleOS
sound demo of the same name.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
The song starts as soon as the window opens and repeats
forever.
As each note sounds, its lyric syllable is appended to the
window, karaoke style, exactly as the original's
.B Play()
prints them.
.PP
Pressing any key stops the song and exits, as the original's
.B ScanChar
loop does.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/ohgreat.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
